<title>USA: Micron Technology Inc Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Micron Technology Inc Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in millions except per share data)</p>
<p>				   QUARTER ENDED	 YEAR ENDED</p>
<p>			     Aug. 29,  Aug. 31,  Aug. 29,  Aug. 31,</p>
<p>				   1996	1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		   $700.5  $1,028.0  $3,653.8  $2,952.7</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold	 550.2     479.5   2,198.4   1,328.7</p>
<p>Selling, general, and</p>
<p>   administrative	    83.8	67.1     297.7     198.7</p>
<p> Research and development  46.1	39.3     191.9     128.8</p>
<p> Restructuring charge     (0.3)	 ---	29.6	 ---</p>
<p>Total costs and expenses</p>
<p>				  679.8     585.9   2,717.6   1,656.2</p>
<p> Operating income	    20.7     442.1     936.2   1,296.5</p>
<p>Gain on merger transaction</p>
<p>				    ---	 ---	 ---	29.0</p>
<p>Interest income (expense)</p>
<p>   net			  (0.6)	 7.5	14.3	25.0</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>				   20.1     449.6     950.5   1,350.5</p>
<p> Income tax provision	 1.5     168.5     357.0     506.4</p>
<p> Net income		    18.6     281.1     593.5     844.1</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>    Primary		    0.09	1.30	2.76	3.95</p>
<p>    Fully diluted	    0.09	1.29	2.76	3.90</p>
<p>Number of shares used in</p>
<p>per share calculations</p>
<p>    Primary		   213.0     216.6     215.0     213.9</p>
<p>    Fully diluted	   213.0     217.4     215.0     216.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q4 net includes a $9 million pretax charge for estimated selling costs on personal computer systems. Latest Q4 net also reflects a reduction of income tax expense of about $6 million, and &quot;the release of previously established accruals upon resolution of product and process rights contingencies&quot; for both semiconductor and personal computer operations totaling $34 million after tax. Micron said fully diluted earnings per share in the lastest fourth quarter benefited by about $0.16 from those adjustments.</p>
